{"text":"Unlike any other creature on this planet, human beings can learn and understand without having experienced. They can think themselves into other people's places. Of course, this is a power like my brand of fictional magic that is morally neutral. One might use such an ability to manipulate or control just as much as to understand or sympathize. And many prefer not to exercise their imaginations at all. They choose to remain comfortably within the bounds of their own experience, never troubling to wonder how it would feel to have been born other than they are. They can refuse to hear screams or peer inside cages. They can close their minds and hearts to any suffering that does not touch them personally. They can refuse to know.","words":[{"text":"Unlike","start":0.7,"end":1.34},{"text":"any","start":1.34,"end":1.76},{"text":"other","start":1.76,"end":2.02},{"text":"creature","start":2.02,"end":2.28},{"text":"on","start":2.28,"end":2.52},{"text":"this","start":2.52,"end":2.68},{"text":"planet","start":2.68,"end":3.12,"punct":","},{"text":"human","start":4.06,"end":4.24},{"text":"beings","start":4.24,"end":4.66},{"text":"can","start":4.66,"end":4.98},{"text":"learn","start":4.98,"end":5.28},{"text":"and","start":5.28,"end":5.56},{"text":"understand","start":5.56,"end":6.14},{"text":"without","start":6.14,"end":6.84},{"text":"having","start":6.84,"end":7.3},{"text":"experienced","start":7.3,"end":8.0,"punct":"."},{"text":"They","start":8.88,"end":9.0},{"text":"can","start":9.0,"end":9.16},{"text":"think","start":9.16,"end":9.44},{"text":"themselves","start":9.44,"end":9.96},{"text":"into","start":9.96,"end":10.6},{"text":"other","start":10.6,"end":10.86},{"text":"people's","start":10.86,"end":11.36},{"text":"places","start":11.36,"end":11.78,"punct":"."},{"text":"Of","start":13.5,"end":13.86},{"text":"course","start":13.86,"end":14.02,"punct":","},{"text":"this","start":14.08,"end":14.26},{"text":"is","start":14.26,"end":14.42},{"text":"a","start":14.42,"end":1